### Requests de exemplo — rode com `dotnet run --project labs/F1-M07-aspnetcore-api/src/F1M07.Api`
### (VS / VS Code com REST Client / Rider executam este arquivo)

@baseUrl = http://localhost:5107

### Lista produtos
GET {{baseUrl}}/products
Accept: application/json

### Cria produto (201 + Location)
# @name criar
POST {{baseUrl}}/products
Content-Type: application/json
X-Correlation-Id: demo-123

{
  "name": "Teclado mecânico",
  "price": 349.90
}

### Detalha o produto criado
@productId = {{criar.response.body.$.id}}
GET {{baseUrl}}/products/{{productId}}

### Altera (204)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/products/{{productId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Teclado mecânico ABNT2",
  "price": 379.90
}

### Desativa (204)
POST {{baseUrl}}/products/{{productId}}/deactivate

### Ativa (204)
POST {{baseUrl}}/products/{{productId}}/activate

### Entrada inválida (400 ValidationProblem)
POST {{baseUrl}}/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "",
  "price": 0
}

### Inexistente (404)
GET {{baseUrl}}/products/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001

### Remove (204)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/products/{{productId}}

### OpenAPI (após habilitar AddOpenApi/MapOpenApi)
GET {{baseUrl}}/openapi/v1.json
